## ✨ Features

### 🔍 AI Assessment
- **Jewelry Type Detection**: Chain, Ring, Bangle, Necklace, Earring, Pendant, Mangalsutra
- **Purity Analysis**: 24K, 22K, 18K, 14K, 10K classification
- **Weight Estimation**: ±20% accuracy from photos
- **Hallmark Detection**: BIS logo + 916/750/585 stamp verification
- **Hollow Detection**: Identifies hollow vs solid jewelry

### 💰 Financial Intelligence
- **Real-time Gold Pricing**: Live API integration
- **Market Value Calculation**: Accurate ₹INR valuation
- **Loan Eligibility**: Instant 75% LTV calculation
- **EMI Estimation**: Monthly payment breakdown

### 🛡️ Risk & Fraud Detection
- **Multi-Image Consensus**: Cross-validates across photos
- **Image Quality Check**: Brightness, blur, resolution validation
- **Consistency Verification**: Cross-signal fraud detection
- **Wear & Tear Analysis**: Surface condition assessment

### 🎨 User Experience
- **Drag & Drop Upload**: Intuitive image uploading
- **Audio Recording**: Built-in tap-test recorder
- **Instant Results**: <5 second processing
- **Beautiful Dashboard**: Responsive Tailwind CSS UI

